  <title xml:lang="EN">ICI project for capacity building for Meteorological Services of Trinidad &amp; Tobago</title>
  <description xml:lang="EN">The Capacity building project for Meteorological Service of Trinidad &amp; Tobago aims to increase the capacity of the use of weather forecasting services in Trinidad &amp; Tobago. The project is submitted a funding of 70 000 euros for the implementation of the updated SmartMet weather production system, the production of pilot products and the capacitation of staff to guarantee continuity. The project will be managed jointly by the meteorological services of Finland and Trinidad &amp; Tobago.</description>
